{"title":"Good sentences","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/953319170/0/marginalrevolution~Good-sentences.html","date":1775404008000,"content":"<blockquote><p>This leads us to the next of Freud’s major contributions to neuroscience: his realization that cognition is, at bottom, <em>wishful</em>.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from the new and notable Mark Solms, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Hidden-Spring-Journey-Source-Consciousness/dp/1324021918/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2QAP0HNYAVXEZ&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.S2Hux81XNjs8vqVc2m1FXTPn-MaEKMMWpvHekrdt3tgPXQcO3H4L_lAX3zu109d1EbqcenT0VY7vPbYUsTRrNourym_q4Ss8WYyaCYt3qKkyvaMueHWvDWroxQ1-DjGyVBemxtvI1i7RKZ1XECq3EHk7433pwZoxakxoTAaDb7c2MjItoOUwwVKOMid2HWwt6TueX-8C4GrVCfnBAy00K5d8egVjSOjhPcdcGvp6Oec.pjOjsc9rmRQC9HtfQXqFnixRUL5XJwmjl6W0vE-oTvo&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=mark+solms&amp;qid=1775403973&amp;sprefix=mark+solms%2Caps%2C144&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">The Only Cure: Freud and the Neuroscience of Mental Healing</a>.  This is a good book for people who underrated Freud, or think he is a mere charlatan.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/good-sentences-9.html\">Good sentences</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/953319170/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/953319170/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/953319170/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/953319170/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz